# L §5.10 Parts (2.1-F10): before its first anchor a place alive before S has "one hole part, of the hole balance,
# possibly anyone's, besides the parts arrivals add"; at that anchor L §5.19's rules apply with the hole part among
# the booked parts.  Each place lives from 2016, has no opening, gets 30.00 on 2021-02-01 (the couple's, rule
# community) and is anchored at 2021-03-31 end at 500.00.  joint: stated parts that cover the total (300.00 the
# couple's, 200.00 Ania's) leave the parts known: the stated figures, carried through.  joint2: no stated parts: the
# booked total is a hole, so the gap's take by an outflow nobody knows could be of any size, and every booked part is
# within its reach (L §5.14 "Only the parts the take could reach under some reading of the holes merge"): one hole part
# of the total, the reading's unknown money (`whose are 500.00 DUK of joint2 at 2021-03-31 end?`, L §8.1).  joint3:
# Ania's 200.00 stated, the unstated rest (300.00, scratch/exp_f10.py) one hole part that can't be Ania's.  joint4: a
# pad reading (its pad's amount a hole, as in 2.0), as joint2.  r: the ledger's rest line: its booked part is the hole
# balance.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2021-06-30
  start 2021-01-01
  end 2021-12-31

source s "test"
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind couples: parties
kind persons: parties
kind banks: place one min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(DUK)
  takes k for w order (if k.owner == ania_tomek then 0 else 1)
place joint: banks DUK lives 2016-09-10..
place joint2: banks DUK lives 2016-09-10..
place joint3: banks DUK lives 2016-09-10..
place joint4: banks DUK lives 2016-09-10..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wb: observed
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = (if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0)

ask q1: bal(joint, 2021-03-31) of ania_tomek, bal(joint, 2021-03-31) of ania, bal(joint, 2021-03-31) of tomek
ask q2: bal(joint2, 2021-03-31), bal(joint2, 2021-03-31) of ania_tomek
ask q3: bal(joint3, 2021-03-31) of ania, bal(joint3, 2021-03-31) of ania_tomek
ask q4: bal(joint4, 2021-03-31), bal(joint4, 2021-03-31) of ania_tomek
ask r: residuals joint3 2021-03

version cast
  cite s
  known 2021-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1988-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1987-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2016-09-10..

version wv
  cite s
  governs 2021-01..2021-03
  known 2021-04-01
  covers joint, joint2, joint3, joint4
  anchor joint
  anchor joint2
  anchor joint3
  pad joint4 from world
  wb[r1] = (on: 2021-02-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to joint amount 30.00 DUK) "r1"
  wb[r2] = (on: 2021-02-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to joint2 amount 30.00 DUK) "r2"
  wb[r3] = (on: 2021-02-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to joint3 amount 30.00 DUK) "r3"
  wb[r4] = (on: 2021-02-01, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to joint4 amount 30.00 DUK) "r4"
  stated[joint] = 500.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint] of ania_tomek = 300.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint] of ania = 200.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint2] = 500.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint3] = 500.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint3] of ania = 200.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
  stated[joint4] = 500.00 DUK at 2021-03-31 end
=== expect
q1: (300.00 DUK, 200.00 DUK, 0.00 DUK)
...
q2: (500.00 DUK, ?"joint2: 500.00 DUK may be ania_tomek's: whose are 500.00 DUK of joint2 at 2021-03-31 end?" (joint2))
...
q3: (200.00 DUK, ?"joint3: 300.00 DUK may be ania_tomek's: whose are 300.00 DUK of joint3 at 2021-03-31 end?" (joint3))
...
q4: (500.00 DUK, ?"joint4: 500.00 DUK may be ania_tomek's: whose are 500.00 DUK of joint4 at 2021-03-31 end?" (joint4))
...
r: residuals joint3 2021-03
  2021-03 balance: model ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3), observed 500.00 DUK, difference ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3)
    balance joint3 2021-03-31 end (anchored): booked ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3), stated 500.00 DUK, gap ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3); of ania: booked 0.00 DUK, stated 200.00 DUK, gap 200.00 DUK; rest: booked ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3), stated 300.00 DUK, gap ?"joint3 has no balance before 2021-03-31" (joint3)
...
